1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:38,260
=Episode 29=

4
00:01:39,620 --> 00:01:41,820
(Prince of Jin's Residence)

5
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:52,310
Look at that sweet little face!

6
00:01:53,150 --> 00:01:54,480
Sleeping so peacefully!

7
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:56,590
Lingyi.

8
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:58,400
Come here.

9
00:02:03,510 --> 00:02:04,480
Dear Chunhua,

10
00:02:05,510 --> 00:02:07,510
you've done so much for my baby and me.

11
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:09,960
Lingyi.

12
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:10,680
- Come on.
- The baby's asleep.

13
00:02:11,150 --> 00:02:12,360
Say goodbye to Aunt Chunhua.

14
00:02:13,190 --> 00:02:13,680
Lingyi!

15
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:14,750
Lingyi!

16
00:02:15,310 --> 00:02:15,840
Your Highness!

17
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:16,870
Your Highness!

18
00:02:22,910 --> 00:02:23,960
Your Highness!

19
00:02:25,190 --> 00:02:26,430
Your Highness!

20
00:02:32,630 --> 00:02:33,590
Your Highness!

21
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:36,150
Your Highness!

22
00:02:39,030 --> 00:02:40,800
Your Highness!

23
00:03:03,660 --> 00:03:06,300
(Drunken Immortal Tavern)

24
00:03:10,500 --> 00:03:12,540
(Residence of the Military Governor
of Lingnan)

25
00:03:17,900 --> 00:03:20,140
(Residence of the Military Governor
of Lingnan)

26
00:03:23,170 --> 00:03:24,470
(Jiang Heng, Military Governor
of Lingnan)

27
00:03:24,470 --> 00:03:26,280
Yan Shang, Collator at Hongwen Hall.

28
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:30,560
Have you heard of him?

29
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:31,910
Never heard of him.

30
00:03:32,710 --> 00:03:34,150
He may be a capital official,

31
00:03:34,630 --> 00:03:36,710
but isn't he just some scribe
at the academy?

32
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:39,000
I seem to recall

33
00:03:39,630 --> 00:03:41,280
that he placed among the top three

34
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:43,000
in last year's imperial examinations.

35
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,190
An upright scholar-official.

36
00:03:49,190 --> 00:03:50,150
Did he say why he's here?

37
00:03:51,150 --> 00:03:52,960
He says he's from this region

38
00:03:53,030 --> 00:03:54,800
and came to pay his respects
while visiting family.

39
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:06,120
(Residence of the Military Governor
of Lingnan)

40
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:06,520
My apologies.

41
00:04:06,870 --> 00:04:08,030
The governor is busy with business.

42
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:09,030
He can't receive you right now.

43
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:09,800
Please forgive us.

44
00:04:10,630 --> 00:04:11,280
You'll have to leave.

45
00:04:12,870 --> 00:04:13,430
I see.

46
00:04:14,870 --> 00:04:15,280
No matter.

47
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:17,390
Thank you anyway.

48
00:04:24,980 --> 00:04:28,489
(Residence of the Military Governor
of Lingnan)

49
00:04:28,531 --> 00:04:29,559
High-ranking officials are hard to meet.

50
00:04:29,601 --> 00:04:31,241
(Drunken Immortal Tavern)
Shall we head home and rest, sir?

51
00:04:33,190 --> 00:04:34,270
If we can't see the big officials,

52
00:04:34,630 --> 00:04:35,680
we'll see the lesser ones.

53
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:38,920
Surely they won't all turn us away.

54
00:04:40,070 --> 00:04:40,390
Come on.

55
00:04:41,070 --> 00:04:41,600
Let's go to the County Office.

56
00:04:43,510 --> 00:04:44,289
My lord! My lord!

57
00:04:44,331 --> 00:04:45,349
May you live a hundred years!

58
00:04:45,390 --> 00:04:46,859
May you live a hundred years, my lord!

59
00:04:46,901 --> 00:04:49,229
May you live a hundred years!
Bless you, my lord!

60
00:04:49,271 --> 00:04:49,621
Get up!

61
00:04:49,670 --> 00:04:51,599
My lord, please give us something
to eat!

62
00:04:51,641 --> 00:04:54,159
Please! Just a little food!

63
00:04:54,201 --> 00:04:55,069
Please!

64
00:04:55,111 --> 00:04:56,799
Please, my lord!

65
00:04:56,841 --> 00:04:57,919
Just a little food!

66
00:04:57,961 --> 00:05:00,359
May you live a hundred years!
Bless you!

67
00:05:00,401 --> 00:05:01,829
Please give us something to eat!

68
00:05:01,871 --> 00:05:03,111
Just a bite, please!

69
00:05:03,300 --> 00:05:03,609
Well,

70
00:05:03,651 --> 00:05:05,021
you must be exhausted
from your journey, my boy.

71
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:07,720
When did you arrive
in our humble county?

72
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:09,240
Oh, by the way,

73
00:05:09,830 --> 00:05:11,360
how has your father been?

74
00:05:13,070 --> 00:05:13,630
Thanks for asking.

75
00:05:14,070 --> 00:05:14,920
He's doing well.

76
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:17,950
You seem to be in excellent health
yourself.

77
00:05:19,190 --> 00:05:19,630
(Zheng Chengqing, County Magistrate)
Not bad.

78
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:20,870
Not bad at all.

79
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:22,560
Come, my boy.

80
00:05:27,750 --> 00:05:29,950
Last year, I happened to pass
by the County Office

81
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:33,310
and saw you
seeing Captain Zhang Renjing out.

82
00:05:34,190 --> 00:05:36,430
He looked well fed
and had plenty to drink.

83
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,480
I assume

84
00:05:38,920 --> 00:05:40,190
you entertained him here.

85
00:05:41,430 --> 00:05:42,070
What a coincidence!

86
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,950
It seems you

87
00:05:44,510 --> 00:05:45,870
know Captain Zhang too.

88
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:47,120
More than that.

89
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:48,040
We know each other very well.

90
00:05:48,870 --> 00:05:50,459
Speaking of Captain Zhang,

91
00:05:50,501 --> 00:05:52,181
he must have had
his ancestors' blessings.

92
00:05:52,510 --> 00:05:53,510
He rose through the ranks so quickly.

93
00:05:54,070 --> 00:05:55,040
But I heard

94
00:05:55,390 --> 00:05:57,800
he owed his rise
to that treacherous eunuch.

95
00:05:58,310 --> 00:05:59,800
Now that the eunuch has fallen,

96
00:05:59,870 --> 00:06:02,270
I wonder what became of Captain Zhang.

97
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:03,310
I know.

98
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:04,680
He's dead.

99
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,270
Dead?

100
00:06:10,950 --> 00:06:11,920
I killed him.

101
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:24,800
I haven't had a chance to tell you.

102
00:06:25,390 --> 00:06:26,560
On this visit home,

103
00:06:27,270 --> 00:06:28,800
I did use visiting family as a pretext.

104
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:29,920
But actually,

105
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:31,920
(Circuit Inspector)
I'm here on official business.

106
00:06:37,310 --> 00:06:38,720
I see you recognize this.

107
00:06:39,190 --> 00:06:39,680
Excellent.

108
00:06:40,390 --> 00:06:41,630
That saves me an explanation.

109
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:42,720
Forgive my ignorance.

110
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:44,430
May I ask what brings
the Circuit Inspector

111
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:45,720
to our county?

112
00:06:47,070 --> 00:06:47,920
Now that Yu's faction has fallen,

113
00:06:48,190 --> 00:06:49,720
the court must restore order.

114
00:06:50,310 --> 00:06:52,160
Even a remote place like Santu County

115
00:06:52,630 --> 00:06:53,310
is still imperial territory.

116
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:55,680
Every official must
be thoroughly investigated

117
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,800
if we're to make a fresh start.

118
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:01,160
I'm afraid

119
00:07:01,950 --> 00:07:04,000
some officials
will lose their positions.

120
00:07:05,510 --> 00:07:06,120
Or perhaps

121
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:08,800
their heads.

122
00:07:10,950 --> 00:07:12,240
Your Excellency! Please spare my life!

123
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,190
At least

124
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:16,310
for the sake of my old friendship
with your father...

125
00:07:16,390 --> 00:07:18,600
My father was unfortunately
driven into the wilderness.

126
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:20,160
Not only did he lose
his household registration,

127
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:22,430
but he's apparently not even
a whole man anymore.

128
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:27,070
Those words...

129
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,830
You said them yourself back then,
didn't you?

130
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:38,270
I'm the sort of man
who never lets a slight go.

131
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:39,720
You really

132
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:42,480
should've watched your mouth that day.

133
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:43,678
I deserve to die!

134
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:44,720
I deserve to die!

135
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:45,950
Forgive me, please!

136
00:07:48,630 --> 00:07:50,000
You've been an official for many years.

137
00:07:50,750 --> 00:07:53,560
Surely you know how much authority
a Circuit Inspector holds.

138
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:56,240
As the Emperor's inspector
of Lingnan Circuit,

139
00:07:56,510 --> 00:07:57,720
I may not be able
to touch military governors

140
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:59,430
or prefects so easily.

141
00:08:00,630 --> 00:08:02,190
But taking a county magistrate's life?

142
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:05,040
All it takes is one more report
to the throne.

143
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:08,830
I wonder if the cases
you've handled over the years

144
00:08:09,870 --> 00:08:11,720
could withstand such scrutiny.

145
00:08:11,830 --> 00:08:13,430
Have mercy, Your Excellency!

146
00:08:14,430 --> 00:08:16,950
I'll... I'll crawl
on my knees to your home

147
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:18,539
and apologize to your father!

148
00:08:18,581 --> 00:08:21,021
Please spare my miserable life!

149
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:25,480
There is one way.

150
00:08:25,870 --> 00:08:26,680
The question is,

151
00:08:27,390 --> 00:08:29,310
are you willing to do me a favor?

152
00:08:30,310 --> 00:08:31,430
Yes! Of course!

153
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:33,150
Anything you ask!

154
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:35,390
Bring me the county's financial records.

155
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:51,720
As for any injustices or illegal acts,

156
00:08:52,630 --> 00:08:53,630
even if you weren't responsible,

157
00:08:55,030 --> 00:08:56,240
someone else surely was.

158
00:09:01,550 --> 00:09:02,600
I trust you'll

159
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:03,960
tell me everything you know.

160
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:06,320
Make a list of everyone involved

161
00:09:07,910 --> 00:09:08,870
and what they did.

162
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:10,320
I'll be

163
00:09:11,030 --> 00:09:13,440
most grateful for your help.

164
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:25,120
(Prince of Jin's Residence)
Your Highness!

165
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:27,870
(Virtue Shines)
Your Highness!

166
00:09:30,750 --> 00:09:34,390
Please give me back my baby,
Your Highness!

167
00:09:34,790 --> 00:09:37,790
We've given her the finest food
and lodging every day.

168
00:09:38,390 --> 00:09:40,000
Why is she crying like that?

169
00:09:41,030 --> 00:09:42,600
How strange!

170
00:09:43,670 --> 00:09:44,200
Indeed.

171
00:09:44,550 --> 00:09:46,200
Everyone knows how kind you are,
Your Highness.

172
00:09:50,870 --> 00:09:51,390
Never mind.

173
00:09:52,790 --> 00:09:53,750
It's only right.

174
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:55,960
After all, my child

175
00:09:56,270 --> 00:09:57,720
happened to be born from her womb.

176
00:09:57,910 --> 00:09:59,120
Your Highness!

177
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:01,000
She doesn't even have to nurse the baby,

178
00:10:01,270 --> 00:10:02,360
or lift a finger.

179
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:04,150
Yet she's still ungrateful.

180
00:10:05,150 --> 00:10:07,840
Thank you for coming personally
to bring gifts for the little prince.

181
00:10:08,390 --> 00:10:09,630
Your Highness!

182
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:15,270
Please give me back my baby!

183
00:10:24,670 --> 00:10:26,120
Your Highness!

184
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:31,080
Please give me back my baby!

185
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:34,790
Attendant Liu.

186
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:41,550
Attendant Liu,

187
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:44,000
this register lists the traitor's
remaining followers

188
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,910
whose offenses were minor
or whose guilt couldn't be proven.

189
00:10:57,620 --> 00:10:59,660
(Liang Yuanhui)

190
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:03,270
Please advise us, Attendant Liu.

191
00:11:03,670 --> 00:11:05,200
If any of the traitors
have escaped justice,

192
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:06,910
His Majesty may be displeased.

193
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:08,790
We'll investigate thoroughly.

194
00:11:09,030 --> 00:11:09,630
Every last one!

195
00:11:24,400 --> 00:11:25,538
(This year: 38 people lost, 10 fled,
9 killed in battle, 6 lost at sea;)

196
00:11:25,539 --> 00:11:26,360
(many sugar-trading ships
diverted to Rongzhou.)

197
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:41,640
(Revised land-allotment records: 450
qing allocated across the townships.)

198
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:45,880
(Shanwei: 8 qing of farmland destroyed.
Current registered households.)

199
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:57,960
(Zhao Shi extorted villagers.
Registrar Li Jie embezzled labor funds.)

200
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:03,080
(Wang Jia: Arrests made, cases dropped.
Wei Feng, Senior Secretary,)

201
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:09,630
Wei Feng, Senior Secretary

202
00:12:10,120 --> 00:12:10,750
(falsely drew military supplies.)
of the Fifth Rank,

203
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:13,240
falsely drew military supplies.

204
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:16,720
Someone!

205
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:26,080
(Chen Da, Bailiff of Santu County)
At your service, sir.

206
00:12:32,340 --> 00:12:34,580
(Wei Feng,
Senior Secretary of the Fifth Rank)

207
00:12:37,670 --> 00:12:38,080
Oh my...

208
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:39,390
That young fellow...

209
00:12:39,550 --> 00:12:41,320
He's actually a Circuit Inspector!

210
00:12:41,390 --> 00:12:42,270
He's got some nerve!

211
00:12:42,670 --> 00:12:44,150
He's already summoned
Senior Secretary Wei for questioning!

212
00:12:45,870 --> 00:12:46,510
- Prefect!
- Prefect!

213
00:12:46,670 --> 00:12:49,120
Prefect, who exactly is this man?

214
00:12:49,320 --> 00:12:50,790
What are we going to do?

215
00:12:50,910 --> 00:12:52,000
Don't panic.

216
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:57,390
But I've heard

217
00:12:58,150 --> 00:12:59,840
he's got a list of names

218
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:01,960
(Wei Feng, Senior Secretary of Shaozhou)
and plans to question everyone on it.

219
00:13:02,270 --> 00:13:02,840
I...

220
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:05,320
I'm just the first.

221
00:13:05,550 --> 00:13:05,840
What?

222
00:13:06,670 --> 00:13:07,150
Prefect, what...

223
00:13:07,750 --> 00:13:08,320
Quiet.

224
00:13:09,270 --> 00:13:11,480
I've already looked into his background.

225
00:13:12,670 --> 00:13:14,600
He's a nobody from the countryside,
with no connections.

226
00:13:15,510 --> 00:13:18,240
His Majesty was probably short of men
after Yu's downfall,

227
00:13:18,720 --> 00:13:19,960
so he promoted this man.

228
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:21,480
Then why

229
00:13:22,150 --> 00:13:23,630
send him here of all places?

230
00:13:26,150 --> 00:13:27,360
Could he already have...

231
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:36,030
Sir, the military governor
has sent for you.

232
00:13:38,750 --> 00:13:40,480
The Circuit Inspector has already
arrived in Santu County.

233
00:13:40,910 --> 00:13:41,630
How do you

234
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:43,240
intend to handle him?

235
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:46,150
We're discussing that very matter.

236
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:49,550
I heard that before summoning
the local officials,

237
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:51,240
he visited the Santu County office.

238
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:53,000
But someone told me

239
00:13:53,630 --> 00:13:55,000
that before meeting Magistrate Zheng,

240
00:13:55,670 --> 00:13:56,870
he visited your residence.

241
00:13:57,600 --> 00:13:58,510
Yes, yes, he did.

242
00:13:58,670 --> 00:13:58,960
Well...

243
00:13:59,080 --> 00:14:00,630
That's because

244
00:14:00,910 --> 00:14:02,750
he attended a local school

245
00:14:02,960 --> 00:14:03,270
and...

246
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,320
was a classmate of my son.

247
00:14:05,790 --> 00:14:08,630
He brought back a few gifts for my son.

248
00:14:09,270 --> 00:14:09,670
But

249
00:14:10,120 --> 00:14:13,270
he never revealed his official position
to me.

250
00:14:13,630 --> 00:14:16,840
Otherwise, I would've made arrangements
much sooner.

251
00:14:17,080 --> 00:14:18,080
That doesn't matter now.

252
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:23,630
At least

253
00:14:24,390 --> 00:14:26,720
your son seems to know him quite well.

254
00:14:27,550 --> 00:14:29,320
With that connection,

255
00:14:29,790 --> 00:14:32,870
he still has to treat you with respect.

256
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:34,840
Surely he'll show you
some consideration.

257
00:14:35,790 --> 00:14:36,480
Prefect Liu.

258
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:46,240
The longer he stays here,

259
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:48,000
the more people he'll implicate,

260
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:49,390
and things

261
00:14:50,270 --> 00:14:51,720
will only get harder to control.

262
00:14:53,320 --> 00:14:54,030
Surely

263
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:56,200
you understand that.

264
00:14:58,960 --> 00:14:59,720
Wei Feng

265
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:02,120
is your most trusted right-hand man.

266
00:15:03,440 --> 00:15:04,960
If he dares summon Wei Feng,

267
00:15:08,480 --> 00:15:09,510
who's next?

268
00:15:14,320 --> 00:15:16,120
Before things get out of hand,

269
00:15:16,630 --> 00:15:18,200
you'd better put an end to this.

270
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:20,600
Understood, sir.

271
00:15:23,120 --> 00:15:23,720
One more thing.

272
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:27,120
A dog won't let go

273
00:15:28,150 --> 00:15:30,030
unless you give it some meat.

274
00:15:31,960 --> 00:15:32,910
Yan Shang

275
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:34,910
has climbed so high

276
00:15:35,630 --> 00:15:37,120
in just a few months.

277
00:15:39,320 --> 00:15:40,720
He must be quite calculating

278
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:42,630
and ruthless.

279
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:46,240
You mean...

280
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:48,870
If necessary,

281
00:15:50,200 --> 00:15:51,960
throw him a few bones to keep him quiet.

282
00:15:55,200 --> 00:15:56,030
For instance,

283
00:15:57,440 --> 00:15:59,120
if you can't save Wei Feng,

284
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:01,240
hand him over.

285
00:16:02,480 --> 00:16:03,270
As for the others,

286
00:16:04,670 --> 00:16:05,720
use your judgment.

287
00:16:19,120 --> 00:16:19,480
Yes, sir.

288
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:25,840
(Residence of the Military Governor
of Lingnan)

289
00:16:25,840 --> 00:16:26,200
Sir!

290
00:16:27,390 --> 00:16:27,720
Sir!

291
00:16:34,390 --> 00:16:35,270
If I can't

292
00:16:36,510 --> 00:16:38,150
get this situation under control,

293
00:16:40,670 --> 00:16:42,630
I'll become a pawn

294
00:16:46,630 --> 00:16:48,320
he can sacrifice whenever he pleases.

295
00:16:49,960 --> 00:16:50,240
Then...

296
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:52,440
what do you plan to do, sir?

297
00:17:01,630 --> 00:17:03,120
Tomorrow,

298
00:17:05,440 --> 00:17:07,030
we'll host a grand banquet here.

299
00:17:08,440 --> 00:17:08,790
Yes.

300
00:17:10,060 --> 00:17:14,890
(Residence of the Prefect of Shaozhou)

301
00:17:14,940 --> 00:17:19,820
(Residence of the Prefect of Shaozhou)

302
00:17:41,270 --> 00:17:41,550
This way, please.

303
00:18:11,720 --> 00:18:14,000
When you visited my residence
the other day, Mr. Yan,

304
00:18:14,240 --> 00:18:15,680
I was unfortunately occupied
with urgent business

305
00:18:15,830 --> 00:18:17,920
and couldn't invite you in
for a proper conversation.

306
00:18:18,680 --> 00:18:20,400
I've arranged today's banquet

307
00:18:20,830 --> 00:18:21,830
to make it up to you.

308
00:18:23,270 --> 00:18:24,720
You're all my seniors.

309
00:18:25,110 --> 00:18:26,070
Making you wait

310
00:18:26,350 --> 00:18:27,590
was rude of me, not you.

311
00:18:29,590 --> 00:18:30,310
Please, have a seat.

312
00:18:30,720 --> 00:18:31,000
After you.

313
00:18:31,350 --> 00:18:31,640
Please.

314
00:18:43,440 --> 00:18:44,480
Mr. Yan,

315
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:46,440
since you're a Circuit Inspector,

316
00:18:47,110 --> 00:18:49,000
why didn't you tell me the other day?

317
00:18:49,750 --> 00:18:51,160
I owe you an apology.

318
00:18:52,750 --> 00:18:54,270
That was my mistake.

319
00:18:56,400 --> 00:18:57,110
To tell you the truth,

320
00:18:57,640 --> 00:18:59,350
I'm from Lingnan myself.

321
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:01,510
I only traveled north
for the examinations last year.

322
00:19:02,110 --> 00:19:04,160
Now that I'm home, meeting
officials who govern my homeland

323
00:19:04,590 --> 00:19:05,030
makes me feel

324
00:19:05,750 --> 00:19:06,590
(Yinbin Hall)
right at home.

325
00:19:07,400 --> 00:19:09,830
Besides, Prefect Liu and I
go back a long way.

326
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:12,440
And you're all
his longtime subordinates.

327
00:19:12,920 --> 00:19:13,440
So, really,

328
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:14,720
fate has brought us together.

329
00:19:15,440 --> 00:19:16,480
We're all among friends here.

330
00:19:19,720 --> 00:19:21,030
But Mr. Yan,

331
00:19:22,310 --> 00:19:23,510
as soon as you arrived,

332
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:26,440
you started summoning officials
for questioning.

333
00:19:26,590 --> 00:19:29,680
Now everyone in Lingnan is on edge.

334
00:19:30,830 --> 00:19:31,790
It almost seems

335
00:19:32,240 --> 00:19:35,200
you're trying to put me in my place.

336
00:19:41,750 --> 00:19:43,590
(Yinbin Hall)
Prefect Liu, Senior Secretary Wei,

337
00:19:44,550 --> 00:19:46,160
since we're all gathered here today,

338
00:19:46,960 --> 00:19:47,480
I'll

339
00:19:48,270 --> 00:19:49,880
get straight to the point.

340
00:19:53,480 --> 00:19:54,160
His Majesty

341
00:19:54,750 --> 00:19:56,400
intends to restore order
throughout the empire.

342
00:19:56,720 --> 00:19:59,240
He appointed me Circuit Inspector
to investigate Lingnan.

343
00:20:00,070 --> 00:20:00,790
Think about it.

344
00:20:02,110 --> 00:20:03,070
Why would he do that?

345
00:20:04,940 --> 00:20:07,580
(Yinbin Hall)

346
00:20:11,400 --> 00:20:14,110
Why make Lingnan his first target?

347
00:20:15,160 --> 00:20:16,960
Surely there's a reason.

348
00:20:19,960 --> 00:20:21,240
If His Majesty has grown suspicious,

349
00:20:21,350 --> 00:20:21,880
he must

350
00:20:22,680 --> 00:20:24,310
have heard some troubling rumors.

351
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:41,550
What do you intend to do, Mr. Yan?

352
00:20:42,750 --> 00:20:43,640
Please, speak plainly.

353
00:20:47,550 --> 00:20:49,310
His Majesty specifically sent me here.

354
00:20:50,440 --> 00:20:51,240
Can I really

355
00:20:51,830 --> 00:20:53,720
return empty-handed and say,

356
00:20:54,270 --> 00:20:55,510
"I found absolutely nothing"?

357
00:20:58,880 --> 00:20:59,590
Gentlemen,

358
00:21:00,270 --> 00:21:01,920
surely you must give me something

359
00:21:02,030 --> 00:21:03,510
to report to His Majesty.

360
00:21:06,510 --> 00:21:07,030
Prefect Liu,

361
00:21:08,160 --> 00:21:09,919
I'm not a stubborn man

362
00:21:09,961 --> 00:21:11,031
who refuses to compromise.

363
00:21:11,790 --> 00:21:15,200
I'd gladly put in a good word
for all of you before His Majesty.

364
00:21:15,920 --> 00:21:16,480
So,

365
00:21:16,960 --> 00:21:18,480
I'll need your cooperation.

366
00:21:19,270 --> 00:21:20,880
Don't leave me standing
before His Majesty

367
00:21:21,640 --> 00:21:22,920
with no answers to give.

368
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:31,510
Then what exactly

369
00:21:32,270 --> 00:21:32,830
do you want to know?

370
00:21:38,640 --> 00:21:39,680
I already have

371
00:21:40,750 --> 00:21:42,070
the financial records of one county.

372
00:21:43,440 --> 00:21:44,750
By my rough calculations,

373
00:21:45,110 --> 00:21:46,160
across the entire Lingnan Circuit,

374
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:49,510
I'm afraid there are
at least ten million strings of coins

375
00:21:50,400 --> 00:21:51,310
have likely gone missing.

376
00:22:03,960 --> 00:22:04,400
Am I right?

377
00:22:09,550 --> 00:22:10,240
Right now,

378
00:22:11,070 --> 00:22:12,000
I'm the only one

379
00:22:12,510 --> 00:22:13,920
who can protect you
from the consequences.

380
00:22:14,790 --> 00:22:15,680
But first,

381
00:22:16,110 --> 00:22:17,750
I need to know exactly

382
00:22:18,110 --> 00:22:18,830
what I'm covering up.

383
00:22:26,920 --> 00:22:27,440
Prefect Liu,

384
00:22:29,270 --> 00:22:31,310
where are Lingnan Circuit's

385
00:22:33,310 --> 00:22:34,030
real financial records?

386
00:23:06,070 --> 00:23:06,790
What is it?

387
00:23:09,070 --> 00:23:10,110
Word from the military governor's
residence.

388
00:23:10,830 --> 00:23:11,790
This man works for the Crown Prince.

389
00:23:26,960 --> 00:23:28,270
I've given it some thought.

390
00:23:30,110 --> 00:23:31,790
What you've said, Mr. Yan,

391
00:23:32,830 --> 00:23:34,480
is truly sincere and heartfelt.

392
00:23:36,790 --> 00:23:38,030
So I suppose

393
00:23:39,070 --> 00:23:40,350
I ought to

394
00:23:41,110 --> 00:23:42,680
show you the same sincerity.

395
00:23:47,680 --> 00:23:49,590
Bring me all the financial ledgers.

396
00:23:49,960 --> 00:23:50,310
Yes, sir.

397
00:23:53,040 --> 00:23:54,600
(Financial Ledgers)

398
00:24:02,640 --> 00:24:06,270
Here's the information you wanted,
Mr. Yan.

399
00:24:09,720 --> 00:24:10,270
Much obliged.

400
00:24:11,920 --> 00:24:12,350
However,

401
00:24:14,160 --> 00:24:15,240
you may only examine them here.

402
00:24:18,350 --> 00:24:18,720
Very well.

403
00:24:19,110 --> 00:24:21,089
You'll need something to report
to His Majesty.

404
00:24:21,131 --> 00:24:22,531
I understand completely.

405
00:24:22,880 --> 00:24:23,590
Therefore,

406
00:24:24,750 --> 00:24:26,480
I'll draw up a list of names.

407
00:24:26,920 --> 00:24:28,960
You may deal with anyone on that list.

408
00:24:29,310 --> 00:24:32,640
As for everyone else,
I ask you to show mercy

409
00:24:32,750 --> 00:24:34,000
and keep the investigation contained.

410
00:24:36,480 --> 00:24:37,200
Of course.

411
00:24:38,780 --> 00:24:40,420
(Lianshan County Financial Ledger,
20th Year of Yingxiang)

412
00:24:47,220 --> 00:24:48,860
(Household Registration Records)

413
00:25:07,860 --> 00:25:10,500
(Ledger: Land Acreage by Category
and Individual Allotment)

414
00:25:56,860 --> 00:25:57,900
(Ledger: Land Acreage by Category
and Individual Allotment)

415
00:26:30,550 --> 00:26:32,000
(Residence of the Prefect of Shaozhou)
Thank you all for today.

416
00:26:32,510 --> 00:26:33,240
Thank you, Prefect Liu.

417
00:26:33,680 --> 00:26:35,070
I'm truly grateful.

418
00:26:36,070 --> 00:26:38,000
We're the ones who should thank you,
Mr. Yan.

419
00:26:38,480 --> 00:26:40,550
Escort Mr. Yan safely
back to his residence.

420
00:26:41,960 --> 00:26:42,590
No need to see me out.

421
00:26:43,350 --> 00:26:43,750
Farewell.

422
00:26:50,790 --> 00:26:51,270
Yan Shang!

423
00:27:10,160 --> 00:27:12,200
That's the military governor's carriage.

424
00:27:20,920 --> 00:27:21,720
What are you doing here?

425
00:27:25,510 --> 00:27:27,510
I'm on my way to Mount Lufu
to pray and happened to pass by.

426
00:27:28,550 --> 00:27:28,960
What?

427
00:27:29,880 --> 00:27:30,830
Do I need your permission?

428
00:27:53,780 --> 00:27:56,420
(Bamboo Goods; Rice Cakes)

429
00:28:03,110 --> 00:28:04,790
I sent Fang Tong to speak
with Jiang Heng.

430
00:28:05,400 --> 00:28:07,110
You nearly got yourself killed!
Do you realize that?

431
00:28:08,440 --> 00:28:09,030
I know.

432
00:28:12,000 --> 00:28:12,510
It's all right.

433
00:28:25,400 --> 00:28:26,270
Have mercy!

434
00:28:26,790 --> 00:28:27,880
Please spare us some food!

435
00:28:33,640 --> 00:28:34,640
Why don't we look around?

436
00:28:35,200 --> 00:28:36,270
Would Your Highness do me the honor?

437
00:28:41,880 --> 00:28:42,310
Stop the carriage!

438
00:28:48,200 --> 00:28:49,270
I'll accompany Her Highness
to do some shopping.

439
00:28:49,680 --> 00:28:50,680
You may return and report back.

440
00:28:50,960 --> 00:28:51,270
Yes, sir.

441
00:28:56,940 --> 00:28:57,780
(Wontons)

442
00:28:59,540 --> 00:29:00,580
(Rice Cakes)

443
00:29:10,020 --> 00:29:11,260
(Shuying Rouge House; Scented Powder)

444
00:29:14,750 --> 00:29:15,310
Let's have a look inside.

445
00:29:18,140 --> 00:29:19,980
(Rice Cakes)

446
00:29:20,100 --> 00:29:21,540
(Wontons)

447
00:29:22,300 --> 00:29:24,860
(Shuying Rouge House)

448
00:29:31,110 --> 00:29:32,160
What can I show you two?

449
00:29:34,640 --> 00:29:36,350
This young gentleman...

450
00:29:38,310 --> 00:29:39,510
You're a returning customer!

451
00:29:39,880 --> 00:29:41,750
You came last year to learn
how to make rouge, didn't you?

452
00:29:42,590 --> 00:29:44,070
I'd never forget a face!

453
00:29:45,240 --> 00:29:46,350
Congratulations, young man.

454
00:29:46,640 --> 00:29:48,270
Looks like you won the lady's heart.

455
00:29:49,000 --> 00:29:49,680
Thanks to you.

456
00:29:52,110 --> 00:29:53,310
What a lovely young lady!

457
00:29:53,880 --> 00:29:55,480
Would you like to see our new lip rouge?

458
00:29:55,790 --> 00:29:56,110
Sure.

459
00:29:57,790 --> 00:29:58,200
Wait.

460
00:29:59,680 --> 00:30:00,440
Not just lip rouge.

461
00:30:01,000 --> 00:30:03,590
Bring out your new face powder,
eyebrow powder, and forehead ornaments.

462
00:30:03,960 --> 00:30:04,640
I'd like to see them all.

463
00:30:05,790 --> 00:30:07,000
Of course! Just a moment!

464
00:30:15,160 --> 00:30:16,030
Congratulations.

465
00:30:18,750 --> 00:30:19,440
For what?

466
00:30:20,440 --> 00:30:21,640
Becoming a Circuit Inspector.

467
00:30:22,350 --> 00:30:23,480
Quite an impressive position,

468
00:30:23,750 --> 00:30:24,270
Yan Shang.

469
00:30:27,070 --> 00:30:28,310
What is he using to threaten you?

470
00:30:30,030 --> 00:30:30,590
Your father?

471
00:30:34,070 --> 00:30:34,680
Your family?

472
00:30:40,160 --> 00:30:40,550
Me?

473
00:30:46,110 --> 00:30:46,640
So,

474
00:30:47,160 --> 00:30:48,270
what exactly have you uncovered?

475
00:30:51,110 --> 00:30:51,920
First, tell me

476
00:30:52,440 --> 00:30:53,680
what you said to Jiang Heng

477
00:30:55,240 --> 00:30:56,310
to make him spare my life.

478
00:31:03,350 --> 00:31:04,200
Did you tell him

479
00:31:05,680 --> 00:31:07,680
that I'm secretly working
for the Crown Prince, just like him?

480
00:31:10,550 --> 00:31:11,110
It seems

481
00:31:12,350 --> 00:31:13,240
you've finished your investigation.

482
00:31:16,160 --> 00:31:16,720
Last night,

483
00:31:18,000 --> 00:31:18,830
at Prefect Liu's residence,

484
00:31:20,030 --> 00:31:20,619
I saw

485
00:31:20,661 --> 00:31:22,461
records of every payment
they sent to the Crown Prince.

486
00:31:28,510 --> 00:31:29,880
And I have you to thank for helping me.

487
00:31:35,480 --> 00:31:35,960
Yan Shang!

488
00:31:50,200 --> 00:31:51,200
Across the entire Lingnan Circuit,

489
00:31:51,790 --> 00:31:53,440
all 24 prefectures and 93 counties,

490
00:31:54,200 --> 00:31:56,200
money squeezed from the people
through oppressive taxes,

491
00:31:57,030 --> 00:31:58,400
even the recent disaster relief funds,

492
00:31:59,200 --> 00:32:00,920
mostly ended up in the Crown Prince's
pockets.

493
00:32:03,070 --> 00:32:04,310
The person His Majesty
wants to bring down

494
00:32:05,310 --> 00:32:06,240
is the Crown Prince.

495
00:32:12,440 --> 00:32:13,070
So,

496
00:32:14,680 --> 00:32:15,720
that's why he sent you to Lingnan.

497
00:32:25,240 --> 00:32:25,750
Yan Shang,

498
00:32:27,880 --> 00:32:29,000
you told me before

499
00:32:30,680 --> 00:32:31,680
that you wanted to go to Sheng'an

500
00:32:32,440 --> 00:32:33,790
to study at the Imperial Academy.

501
00:32:34,960 --> 00:32:36,200
That was the first time you lied to me.

502
00:32:36,920 --> 00:32:37,480
This time,

503
00:32:38,350 --> 00:32:39,160
you told me

504
00:32:39,720 --> 00:32:40,590
you came to Lingnan

505
00:32:41,680 --> 00:32:43,310
because you'd requested leave
to visit your family.

506
00:32:46,270 --> 00:32:47,070
That's twice now!

507
00:32:48,270 --> 00:32:49,200
I'm warning you.

508
00:32:49,830 --> 00:32:50,830
Three strikes, and you're out.

509
00:32:59,750 --> 00:33:00,440
You two.

510
00:33:01,110 --> 00:33:02,110
Come take a look, you two.

511
00:33:09,070 --> 00:33:10,350
Come on, take a look!

512
00:33:11,110 --> 00:33:13,160
These are our latest cosmetics.

513
00:33:13,550 --> 00:33:15,720
We've got forehead ornaments, rouge,
and lip rouge!

514
00:33:16,000 --> 00:33:16,510
Have a look!

515
00:33:27,790 --> 00:33:28,400
Young man,

516
00:33:29,030 --> 00:33:31,030
this eyebrow powder is all the rage.

517
00:33:31,310 --> 00:33:32,400
Why not let your girl try it?

518
00:34:16,840 --> 00:34:17,510
(Serene and Content)
I'm done playing.

519
00:34:18,320 --> 00:34:19,070
Your Majesty...

520
00:34:21,670 --> 00:34:23,190
Your mind is elsewhere.

521
00:34:25,550 --> 00:34:26,030
Yes.

522
00:34:27,070 --> 00:34:28,000
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

523
00:34:29,440 --> 00:34:30,360
What's on your mind?

524
00:34:31,320 --> 00:34:32,880
I wouldn't lie to Your Majesty.

525
00:34:34,030 --> 00:34:35,670
I'm thinking about a former student.

526
00:34:39,840 --> 00:34:41,030
By my reckoning,

527
00:34:42,000 --> 00:34:43,030
he should have been in Lingnan

528
00:34:43,510 --> 00:34:45,000
for several days now.

529
00:34:47,360 --> 00:34:48,150
Your Majesty,

530
00:34:49,710 --> 00:34:52,030
(Serene and Content)
he once told me

531
00:34:52,960 --> 00:34:54,150
that if he entered public service,

532
00:34:54,280 --> 00:34:56,400
he would punish the wicked
and bring peace to the realm.

533
00:34:57,190 --> 00:34:58,190
It seems

534
00:34:58,440 --> 00:35:00,670
he truly has the talent

535
00:35:00,880 --> 00:35:02,630
and the ambition to do so.

536
00:35:05,360 --> 00:35:06,550
What a pity.

537
00:35:08,510 --> 00:35:10,070
A pity he was born in troubled times.

538
00:35:12,030 --> 00:35:13,259
In an age of peace and prosperity,

539
00:35:13,301 --> 00:35:15,941
he might become a chancellor
who brings the empire to greatness.

540
00:35:17,400 --> 00:35:18,710
But in times like these,

541
00:35:19,670 --> 00:35:20,760
with the court as it is,

542
00:35:22,550 --> 00:35:25,110
the whole edifice is crumbling,
and one man cannot save it.

543
00:35:27,440 --> 00:35:28,880
He can only serve as a blade,

544
00:35:29,630 --> 00:35:30,880
worn down until it breaks.

545
00:35:33,280 --> 00:35:33,960
Your Majesty...

546
00:35:34,190 --> 00:35:37,320
If we're to put his talents
and ambition to good use,

547
00:35:37,920 --> 00:35:39,000
the best place for him

548
00:35:39,710 --> 00:35:40,590
is Lingnan,

549
00:35:41,230 --> 00:35:44,190
where he can clash
with my dear son, the Crown Prince.

550
00:35:45,510 --> 00:35:47,480
Either one will crush the other,

551
00:35:48,190 --> 00:35:48,710
or

552
00:35:50,230 --> 00:35:51,510
they'll destroy each other.

553
00:35:59,480 --> 00:36:02,280
Since Your Majesty has already decided

554
00:36:02,880 --> 00:36:06,630
to use Yan Shang to cut out the rot
in Lingnan,

555
00:36:07,800 --> 00:36:10,230
why did you let Princess Danyang
go there too?

556
00:36:11,030 --> 00:36:12,440
To protect Yan Shang,

557
00:36:13,190 --> 00:36:14,360
Her Highness

558
00:36:14,630 --> 00:36:19,030
will surely do everything
she can to stop his investigation.

559
00:36:21,840 --> 00:36:23,049
Such a fine blade...

560
00:36:23,091 --> 00:36:25,341
If it breaks in Lingnan
after just one use,

561
00:36:25,440 --> 00:36:27,760
even I would consider that a waste.

562
00:36:28,920 --> 00:36:30,400
Wanyao is a clever girl.

563
00:36:31,110 --> 00:36:33,710
Perhaps she can help him
come back alive.

564
00:36:34,670 --> 00:36:36,760
With a little more sharpening,

565
00:36:38,590 --> 00:36:40,760
the blade can be used again.

566
00:36:45,960 --> 00:36:46,760
(Shuying Rouge House)
Come again!

567
00:37:00,030 --> 00:37:00,960
They're still following us.

568
00:37:03,110 --> 00:37:03,550
Follow me.

569
00:37:14,940 --> 00:37:15,780
(Flatbread)

570
00:37:16,220 --> 00:37:17,460
(Wang's Tea Shop)

571
00:37:40,590 --> 00:37:41,000
Where'd they go?

572
00:37:41,590 --> 00:37:41,960
This way!

573
00:37:57,070 --> 00:37:57,880
This is a nice spot.

574
00:37:58,920 --> 00:37:59,960
You certainly know where to go.

575
00:38:03,360 --> 00:38:04,670
This is my hometown, after all.

576
00:38:05,110 --> 00:38:05,920
What are you going to do?

577
00:38:08,670 --> 00:38:09,550
Do His Majesty's bidding

578
00:38:10,630 --> 00:38:11,480
and bring down the Crown Prince?

579
00:38:14,480 --> 00:38:15,190
Do you realize

580
00:38:16,280 --> 00:38:17,190
that if you do this,

581
00:38:18,030 --> 00:38:19,000
the Crown Prince won't be

582
00:38:19,630 --> 00:38:20,590
the only one facing ruin?

583
00:38:22,760 --> 00:38:23,280
Your Highness,

584
00:38:25,150 --> 00:38:26,280
you can wash your hands of all this

585
00:38:27,320 --> 00:38:28,190
and retreat to safety.

586
00:38:28,670 --> 00:38:29,670
But I won't!

587
00:38:32,110 --> 00:38:32,590
Yan Shang,

588
00:38:33,110 --> 00:38:33,710
you know

589
00:38:34,960 --> 00:38:36,230
how much I risked

590
00:38:36,760 --> 00:38:37,510
to secretly meet

591
00:38:37,920 --> 00:38:38,880
military commanders
for the Crown Prince.

592
00:38:39,320 --> 00:38:39,960
You also know

593
00:38:40,320 --> 00:38:42,960
how much time and effort I spent

594
00:38:43,510 --> 00:38:44,800
winning those officers over.

595
00:38:45,320 --> 00:38:46,590
They're not just loyal
to the Crown Prince.

596
00:38:47,030 --> 00:38:47,920
They're loyal to me too.

597
00:38:49,190 --> 00:38:50,030
Someday, I'll need them

598
00:38:50,550 --> 00:38:51,800
to protect myself.

599
00:38:54,070 --> 00:38:55,190
Must you really take away

600
00:38:55,920 --> 00:38:57,760
the support I worked so hard to build?

601
00:38:59,030 --> 00:39:00,360
Your Highness, on your way here,

602
00:39:02,070 --> 00:39:04,030
did you see what Lingnan has become?

603
00:39:10,110 --> 00:39:11,070
Fields lie abandoned.

604
00:39:14,480 --> 00:39:15,360
Families are torn apart.

605
00:39:17,320 --> 00:39:18,320
There are hungry, destitute children,

606
00:39:20,920 --> 00:39:23,030
far more than in Sheng'an's Infirmary.

607
00:39:32,670 --> 00:39:33,190
This

608
00:39:34,030 --> 00:39:35,280
is my home.

609
00:39:39,440 --> 00:39:40,400
Before I came here,

610
00:39:41,630 --> 00:39:44,000
I had no idea they'd brought Lingnan
to such ruin.

611
00:39:44,840 --> 00:39:45,480
Otherwise,

612
00:39:46,230 --> 00:39:47,760
do you think I'd have stood by
and done nothing?

613
00:39:48,000 --> 00:39:48,630
I believe you.

614
00:39:50,670 --> 00:39:51,880
I believe you didn't know.

615
00:39:53,030 --> 00:39:54,320
Then keep believing in me.

616
00:39:56,280 --> 00:39:58,110
Believe that one day,

617
00:39:59,110 --> 00:40:00,320
I'll have the power

618
00:40:01,150 --> 00:40:02,190
to restore military discipline,

619
00:40:02,760 --> 00:40:03,590
cut out the corruption,

620
00:40:04,440 --> 00:40:05,440
and root out

621
00:40:06,230 --> 00:40:07,110
these long-standing abuses.

622
00:40:13,230 --> 00:40:14,000
But Your Highness,

623
00:40:15,840 --> 00:40:16,710
the officials here

624
00:40:17,670 --> 00:40:19,419
have been imposing crushing taxes
and exploiting the people

625
00:40:19,461 --> 00:40:20,901
for countless years.

626
00:40:22,840 --> 00:40:24,070
It didn't start with the Crown Prince,

627
00:40:25,280 --> 00:40:26,339
or with Yu Cheng'an,

628
00:40:26,381 --> 00:40:28,421
or even with the Rebellion
of the Seven Military Governors.

629
00:40:30,590 --> 00:40:31,000
This place

630
00:40:33,280 --> 00:40:34,760
is rotten to the core.

631
00:40:37,360 --> 00:40:38,510
People die here every day.

632
00:40:39,110 --> 00:40:40,550
Every year, the land is littered
with victims of starvation.

633
00:40:43,190 --> 00:40:43,630
Your Highness,

634
00:40:45,840 --> 00:40:46,630
what this place needs

635
00:40:48,280 --> 00:40:49,670
is swift, decisive justice

636
00:40:51,070 --> 00:40:52,070
to root out

637
00:40:53,320 --> 00:40:54,400
every trace of corruption.

638
00:40:54,590 --> 00:40:56,280
Are you going to root me out too?

639
00:41:07,760 --> 00:41:08,320
Yan Shang,

640
00:41:09,550 --> 00:41:10,230
promise me.

641
00:41:12,920 --> 00:41:14,150
You found nothing here.

642
00:41:17,070 --> 00:41:18,440
Forget everything that happened here.

643
00:41:19,880 --> 00:41:20,360
Yan Shang,

644
00:41:21,920 --> 00:41:22,920
one day,

645
00:41:23,960 --> 00:41:24,880
I'll set things right

646
00:41:26,360 --> 00:41:27,550
in my own way.

647
00:41:29,710 --> 00:41:30,630
Trust me.

648
00:41:34,030 --> 00:41:34,920
Promise me.

649
00:41:45,550 --> 00:41:46,000
All right.

650
00:41:47,460 --> 00:41:49,090
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

651
00:41:49,140 --> 00:41:51,880
♪- May time be free of pain;
- Lights fade, seasons turn♪

652
00:41:51,930 --> 00:41:54,050
♪You're the only one I need♪

653
00:41:54,710 --> 00:42:01,480
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

654
00:42:01,860 --> 00:42:04,980
♪- Be my one and only in this world;
- Be my one and only in this life♪

655
00:42:05,390 --> 00:42:07,270
♪My last untouched innocence♪

656
00:42:12,550 --> 00:42:13,510
That's an order.

657
00:42:14,760 --> 00:42:15,280
You're coming

658
00:42:16,030 --> 00:42:16,920
back to Sheng'an with me right now.

659
00:42:20,400 --> 00:42:21,760
What about your escort and attendants?

660
00:42:22,230 --> 00:42:23,150
I only brought Fang Tong.

661
00:42:23,880 --> 00:42:25,110
Jiang Heng has kept him
at his residence.

662
00:42:25,920 --> 00:42:26,800
We've agreed

663
00:42:27,510 --> 00:42:28,590
to leave separately.

664
00:42:29,630 --> 00:42:31,400
I've hired a carriage
from a local merchant.

665
00:42:31,630 --> 00:42:32,320
It's waiting at the city gate.

666
00:42:32,960 --> 00:42:33,710
I told them

667
00:42:34,320 --> 00:42:36,320
I'm taking my husband north
to visit my family.

668
00:42:37,000 --> 00:42:37,550
When we get there,

669
00:42:38,070 --> 00:42:40,150
speak a little of the local dialect
to the driver.

670
00:42:48,440 --> 00:42:48,960
Looks like

671
00:42:50,510 --> 00:42:51,800
you've thought of everything.

672
00:42:56,550 --> 00:42:57,000
Wanyao,

673
00:42:57,920 --> 00:42:58,800
before we leave,

674
00:43:00,550 --> 00:43:01,760
come home with me to say goodbye.

675
00:43:07,400 --> 00:43:09,110
Shang, why so suddenly?

676
00:43:09,480 --> 00:43:10,880
You just got back,
and now you're leaving?

677
00:43:11,400 --> 00:43:13,070
Didn't you promise to stay?

678
00:43:15,510 --> 00:43:16,760
I'll come back to visit whenever I can.

679
00:43:29,920 --> 00:43:30,440
Xiaozhou,

680
00:43:31,710 --> 00:43:32,510
take care of yourself,

681
00:43:33,000 --> 00:43:34,550
and look after our elder brother
and Father.

682
00:43:53,840 --> 00:43:54,550
Father.

683
00:43:57,670 --> 00:43:58,320
Take care!

684
00:44:53,090 --> 00:44:57,690
♪I gaze at high peaks
and sails far away♪

685
00:44:58,190 --> 00:45:01,390
♪With the world in my heart,
I leave the shore♪

686
00:45:02,360 --> 00:45:07,390
♪Frost on my shoulders,
joys and sorrows stretch afar♪

687
00:45:07,760 --> 00:45:10,990
♪A thousand miles of lights
keep me company♪

688
00:45:11,710 --> 00:45:12,400
Shang!

689
00:45:12,670 --> 00:45:13,400
Shang!

690
00:45:13,920 --> 00:45:14,510
Shang!

691
00:45:14,552 --> 00:45:15,430
♪By noon, the mist will lift;
rivers will bend♪

692
00:45:15,480 --> 00:45:16,190
Shang!

693
00:45:17,360 --> 00:45:19,360
Take good care of yourself, Shang!

694
00:45:19,402 --> 00:45:20,490
♪Today, lean on the rail with me again♪

695
00:45:21,890 --> 00:45:27,070
♪Tread the boundless clouds
and rise with the wind♪

696
00:45:27,500 --> 00:45:30,310
♪March to the gates
with fearless hearts♪

697
00:45:32,820 --> 00:45:37,560
♪Break every gate♪

698
00:45:38,980 --> 00:45:43,220
(Next Episode Preview)

699
00:45:44,280 --> 00:45:44,590
What's wrong?

700
00:45:45,280 --> 00:45:46,550
Hoofbeats are approaching.

701
00:45:47,110 --> 00:45:47,920
Horses moving that fast

702
00:45:48,360 --> 00:45:49,480
aren't privately owned.

703
00:45:51,110 --> 00:45:51,840
This coachman is up to something!

704
00:45:52,190 --> 00:45:52,630
Hold on tight!

705
00:46:00,161 --> 00:46:03,454
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

706
00:46:06,139 --> 00:46:11,055
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

707
00:46:13,249 --> 00:46:19,094
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

708
00:46:19,594 --> 00:46:24,820
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

709
00:46:27,589 --> 00:46:32,380
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

710
00:46:33,216 --> 00:46:39,295
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

711
00:46:41,096 --> 00:46:44,246
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

712
00:46:44,246 --> 00:46:45,894
♪Burning bright as a song♪

713
00:46:45,946 --> 00:46:49,670
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

714
00:46:50,048 --> 00:46:54,714
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

715
00:46:55,333 --> 00:46:59,374
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

716
00:46:59,865 --> 00:47:01,980
♪Not a single hour less♪

717
00:47:02,020 --> 00:47:08,966
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

718
00:47:09,729 --> 00:47:13,182
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

719
00:47:13,362 --> 00:47:16,507
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

720
00:47:16,946 --> 00:47:23,583
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

721
00:47:23,980 --> 00:47:26,018
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

722
00:47:26,018 --> 00:47:28,494
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

723
00:47:28,532 --> 00:47:31,001
♪You're the only one I need♪

724
00:47:31,205 --> 00:47:38,092
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

725
00:47:38,404 --> 00:47:41,675
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

726
00:47:41,980 --> 00:47:45,153
♪My last untouched innocence♪

727
00:47:45,477 --> 00:47:48,903
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

728
00:47:49,136 --> 00:47:52,361
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

729
00:47:52,692 --> 00:47:59,488
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

730
00:47:59,857 --> 00:48:01,919
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

731
00:48:01,920 --> 00:48:04,423
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

732
00:48:04,470 --> 00:48:06,808
♪You're the only one I need♪

733
00:48:07,039 --> 00:48:13,874
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

734
00:48:14,223 --> 00:48:15,841
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

735
00:48:15,971 --> 00:48:17,767
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

736
00:48:18,124 --> 00:48:21,141
♪You're the only one I need♪

737
00:48:21,181 --> 00:48:22,508
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)

